      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "And again today i have some trouble with friends. I was in the world and cannot see friends but they are in the world (listing showed it) and after some minutes i realized it must new update.\nQuick check Discord and it's indeed another update.\nVRChat has nothing in home to warn others, so i must use Discord to hopefully reach them. It's just annoying.\nCome on, this is simple feature... and very important.",
